<SubSection title="First client meeting" id="First client meeting">
<p>Instructions for Future Communication with Clients:
In odd numbered weeks, starting in Week 3, your team should send one email to your client, copying all teaching staff and team members. 
Undergraduates should write the email, send to your MEng project managers, and then MEng students edit and send along to client.
This email should detail: #1 Work completed in the previous weeks, #2 Questions you have for the client or questions you will seek advice on that week, #3 Plans for the next two weeks.
Be sure to note who wrote the email.
Be proactive about communicating with your client. You may not always hear back, but your group should be emailing your client every other week with an update email and copying the teaching staff.</p>
</SubSection>

